> _2012}) * `total_sales2012' + ${nominal_gas_markup_2013} * (${cpi_${dollar_year}} / ${cpi_2013}) * `total_sales2013' + ${nominal_gas_markup_2014} * (${cpi_${dollar_year}} / ${cpi_2014}
> ) * `total_sales2014') ///
