. local resource_cost = 0.92 * `consumer_price' - `jet_fuel_markup' - `tax_rate' //economy-wide 8% markup from De Loecker et al. (2020)

. di in red "resource cost is `resource_cost'"
resource cost is .4584962551674266

. 
