.         
.     * Adding the rebound effect to the utility producer WTP
.     local wtp_private = `wtp_private' - (1 - `rbd_coeff') * `wtp_prod_u'
.         local wtp_prod_u = `rbd_coeff' * `wtp_prod_u' 
. 
